    "t": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 253 236\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Labyrint med tydligt rutnät; rader A till C, kolumner 1 till 4\" style=\"max-width:253px;width:100%;height:auto\"><title>Grön ruta: start. Röd ruta: mål. Mörka rutor: väggar.</title><text x=\"65\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">1</text><text x=\"117\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">2</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">4</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">A</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#22a05a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"91\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"143\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#d94343\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">B</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"91\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"143\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#111827\">C</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"91\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"143\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"138\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><text x=\"117\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">5</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">5</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"209\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#22a05a\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Start</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"209\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#d94343\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#111827\">Mål</text></svg><p>Kostnad per ruta: 5 i de markerade rutorna, annars 1. Start kostar 0. Använd Manhattanavstånd.</p><p>a) Ange vägen och kostnaden med girig bäst först.</p><p>b) Ange vägen och kostnaden med UCS.</p><p>c) Varför blir kostnaderna olika?</p>",
